007600     05  TOT-ONHAND-VALUE          PIC S9(12)V99  VALUE 0.
007700     05  TOT-RCVD-NOT-PAID         PIC S9(10)  VALUE 0.
007800
007900 COPY TDATECHK IN COPYLIB.
