009900     05  FILLER                     PIC X(67)
010000         VALUE "  MATERIAL COST VALUE REPORT   ".
010100     05  FILLER                     PIC X(5)   VALUE "TIME ".
010200     05  TIME-H2                    PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.
010300
010400 01  HEADER4.
