011500         VALUE "MATL CODE    DESCRIPTION".
011600     05  FILLER                     PIC X(45)
011700         VALUE "UM RC ACCOUNT    ACT COST      QTY PD".
011800     05  FILLER                     PIC X(49)
011900         VALUE "VALUE            STD COST     NOT INV".
012000
012100 01  BLANK-LINE                     PIC X(133)   VALUE SPACES.
012200
