012400     05  FILLER-TOT                 PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
012500     05  PRT-CLASS                  PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
012600     05  FILLER                     PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
012700     05  PRT-MATL-CODE              PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.
012800     05  PRT-WRITEDOWN              PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
012900     05  FILLER                     PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
013000     05  PRT-DESCR                  PIC X(30)  VALUE SPACES.
013100     05  FILLER                     PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
013200     05  PRT-UM                     PIC XX     VALUE SPACES.
013300     05  FILLER                     PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
013400     05  PRT-RC                     PIC XX     VALUE SPACES.
013500     05  FILLER                     PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
013600     05  PRT-ACCOUNT                PIC X(6)   VALUE SPACES.
013700     05  FILLER                     PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
013800     05  PRT-CUR-ACT-COST           PIC ZZZZZZ.ZZZZ-.
013900     05  FILLER                     PIC X(2)   VALUE SPACES.
014000     05  PRT-CUR-ONHAND-PD          PIC Z(10)-.
014100     05  FILLER                     PIC XX     VALUE SPACES.
014200     05  PRT-CUR-VALUE              PIC Z(12).99-.
014300     05  FILLER                     PIC X(2)   VALUE SPACES.
014400     05  PRT-STD-COST               PIC ZZZZZZ.ZZZZ-.
014500     05  FILLER                     PIC X(2)   VALUE SPACES.
014600     05  PRT-UNITS-RCVD-NOT-PD      PIC Z(10)-.
014700
014800 01  PRT-CLASS-LINE.
014900     05  PRT-TOT-DESCR.
015000         10  FILLER                 PIC X  VALUE SPACES.
015100         10  PRT-LITERAL            PIC X(12).
