015300         10  FILLER                 PIC X  VALUE SPACES.
015400         10  PRT-CLASS-DESCR        PIC X(57)  VALUE SPACES.
015500     05  PRT-CLASS-CUR-ONHAND-PD    PIC Z(10)-.
015600     05  FILLER                     PIC XX     VALUE SPACES.
015700     05  PRT-CLASS-ONHAND-PD-VAL    PIC Z(12).99-.
015800     05  FILLER                     PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
015900     05  PRT-CLASS-RCVD-NOT-INV     PIC Z(10)-.
